        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Revolutionary ‘Nano Adsorption’ Filter Technology",
        "content": "<p>Ordinary filters can load up with trapped material over time, which can reduce flow and affect taste. To solve this crucial problem, we’ve developed revolutionary Nano Adsorption technology.<br/><br/><strong>How does it work?</strong></p><p>First, we use granular activated carbon derived from natural coconut husks to remove chemicals, toxins, and heavy metals such as zinc and lead. We use a dense, high-grade carbon structure engineered to maintain consistent flow and long filter life. This filtration process mimics nature and keeps oxygen and mineral content unchanged, giving the water a spring-like freshness and a wholesome taste that’s second to none.</p>",
